cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the article named in references.
title: >-
  Qyunhan: a virtual cell that separates what it knows from what it doubts
abstract: >-
  A program-resolution virtual cell with calibrated abstention. A closed-form
  shared-latent estimator places four cell lines in one low-dimensional space and
  predicts a target line's programme profile from its sources; a split-conformal
  layer on relative error, ordered by a hardness head, decides whether a claim is
  delivered, flagged, abstained from, or returned as an experiment.
